      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: ₹0.55 loss per share (vs ₹0.36 loss in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: ₹0.55 loss per share (further deteriorated from ₹0.36 loss in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹71.9m (up 4.9% from 3Q 2025). Net loss: ₹4.88m (loss widened 50% from 3Q 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 52% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 2% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
